return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T18:00:29+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T18:00:29+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Ta gbigbalejo Zinn Digital® lati oju opo wẹẹbu WordPress ti ara rẹ — WordPress, WooCommerce, agbari, atunta, awọsanma ati gbigbalejo VPS. Wa ki o si pese awọn orukọ ìkápá lati akọọlẹ atunta rẹ, wọle fun awọn alabara rẹ taara sinu panẹli gbigbalejo wọn, ki o si pese gbigbalejo laifọwọyi nigbati a ba sanwo fun aṣẹ WooCommerce kan.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Pẹpẹ ìgbàlejò náà fèsì pẹ̀lú ipò %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Wa orúkọ àgbègbè rẹ','Search'=>'Ṣawari','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Kò sí àwọn àfikún tí a yẹ̀wò fún orúkọ yẹn.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Ìwárí orúkọ ààyè kò sí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí ní báyìí.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'A kò lè kàn sí ibi ìforúkọsílẹ̀ orúkọ àkàwé (domain registry) lẹ́ẹ̀kan yí. Jọ̀wọ́ tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi nígbà díẹ̀ sí i.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ API náà ti sọnù tàbí kò wúlò mọ́. Ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ lábẹ́ Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Kókó API yìí kò ní àṣẹ sites.view, èyí tí ìwárí orúkọ ààyè nilò. Ṣàfikún rẹ̀ mọ́ kókó náà nínú pẹpẹ alátúntà rẹ, tàbí kí o pa kókó náà rẹ́ níhìn-ín láti padà sí ìwárí fún gbogbo ènìyàn.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Àwọn alámòójútó nìkan ló ń rí èyí:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'A kò le ṣayẹwo eyi — gbiyanju lẹẹkansi','Already registered'=>'Ti forúkọ sílẹ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Wà lárọ̀ọ́wọ́tó — béèrè iye rẹ̀ lọ́wọ́ wa','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Wà — %1$s %2$s fún ọdún àkọ́kọ́','Register it'=>'Forukọsilẹ rẹ','Manage my hosting'=>'Ṣakoso iṣakale mi','Please sign in first.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ wọlé ná.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Akiifọwọsi yii ko ti sopọ mọ iṣẹ igbalejo kan sibẹsibẹ.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Pẹpẹ ìgbàlejò náà kò da ọ̀nà ìsopọ̀ ìwọlé padà.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Àkójọ irinṣẹ́ Olùtún-tà','Account'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀','Features'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀yà','Styling'=>'Ṣíṣe àkójọpọ̀ ìrísí','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Àwọn aṣojú AI (MCP)','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Gba àwọn aṣojú AI láyè (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Paa: àwọn irinṣẹ́ tí ó wà nísàlẹ̀ yìí àti àwọn ipa-ọ̀nà REST wọn kò tíì fi orúkọ sílẹ̀ rárá.','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀ olùtúnrajà Zinn Digital® rẹ','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Ṣẹda kọkọrọ API ti alatunta ninu dasibodu Zinn® rẹ labẹ Olùgbéejáde → Awọn kọkọrọ API, ki o si lẹ mọ ibi.','Reseller API key'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ API ti atunta','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'Wọ́n wà lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí nìkan, a kì í sì fi kún iṣẹ́ ìkójáde tàbí ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò kankan rárá.','Plan to provision'=>'Ètò láti pèsè','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Kóòdù ètò tí a fi àwọn oníbàárà tuntun sí. Fi sílẹ̀ láìkọ nǹkan sí i kí a lè máa bi yín lélè ní gbogbo ìgbà.','API address'=>'Àdírẹ́sì API','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Fi èyí sílẹ̀ láìfọwọ́kàn àfi tí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn® bá ní kí o yí i padà.','Control-panel address'=>'Àdírẹ́sì pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'Ibi ti ọ̀na-ìsopọ̀ "Gbígbàlejò mi" ń darí àwọn oníbàárà yín sí.','Domain search'=>'Ìwárí orúkọ ààyè','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'Pese koodu kukuru [zinn_domain_search]','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Fi shortcode si oju-iwe eyikeyi lati gba awọn alejo laaye lati ṣayẹwo agbegbe kan ki wọn si ra nipasẹ rẹ.','Panel link'=>'Ìsopọ̀ pánẹ́ẹ̀lì','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Fi ọna asopọ "Alejo gbigba mi" han fun awọn onibara ti o wọle','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'Pese WooCommerce','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'Pese gbigbalejo laifọwọyi nigbati aṣẹ WooCommerce ba pari','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Ó máa ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí àwọn àṣẹ tí ó ní ọjà tí ẹ ti so pọ̀ mọ́ ètò Zinn® nìkan.','Domain search appearance'=>'Ìrísí ìwárí orúkọ ààyè','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Widget yii n ṣe afihan ninu akori tirẹ. Yan tẹlẹ, tabi ṣeto awọn awọ tirẹ — boya ọna kankan kankan ko ṣe afikun si awọn oju-iwe rẹ ti alejo le rii bi tiwa.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'Gbogbo kíláàsì tí widget náà ń lò ni a tò sí inú readme ti plugin náà, kí olùgbéejáde le ṣe àtúnkọ ohunkóhun tí àtòtẹ́lẹ̀ kò kárí.','Follow my theme'=>'Tẹle akori mi','Soft'=>'Rirọ','High contrast'=>'Iyatọ to ga','Compact'=>'Kíkuru','Buy-link colour'=>'Àwọ̀ ọ̀na-ìsopọ̀ ríra','“Available” colour'=>'Àwọ̀ "Wà"','“Could not check” colour'=>'Àwọ̀ "Kò le yẹ́wò"','Error colour'=>'Àwọ̀ àṣìṣe','Corner rounding'=>'Ìyípo igun','Space inside each row'=>'Ààyè nínú ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan','Text size'=>'Ìwọ̀n àkọsílẹ̀','Domain-name weight'=>'Ìwọ̀n orúkọ ààyè','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí kókó API olùtúntà.','Domain search already works without one, at the public prices. The panel link and WooCommerce provisioning need a key: create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys.'=>'Ìwárí orúkọ ààyè ti ń ṣiṣẹ́ láìsí i, ní àwọn iye owó fún gbogbo ènìyàn. Ìsopọ̀ páńẹ́ẹ̀lì àti ìpèsè WooCommerce nílò kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan: ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀kan nínú pátákó ìdarí Zinn® rẹ lábẹ́ Olùgbédàgbà → Àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Ṣí pátákó ìdarí Zinn® mi','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'Kókó kan ti wa ni tito, ṣùgbọ́n kò sí ohun tí a tan.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Kò sí ọ̀kan nínú àwọn àbùdá mẹ́tẹ̀ẹ̀ta tí a mú ṣiṣẹ́, nítorí náà àfikún yìí kò ṣe ohunkóhun lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ. Tan ohun tí o nílò lábẹ́ Àwọn àbùdá.','Open Features'=>'Ṣí Àwọn Àbùdá','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'Ti ṣetan — a ti tan ẹ̀yà %d.','Selling from'=>'Tita lati','Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Kò tíì sí kókó kọ́kọ́rọ́ API, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a so pọ̀.','Not connected: %s'=>'Kò sopọ̀: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'Ti sopọ. Ètò àtúntà yín ni %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Kò sí bọ́tìnì API Zinn® tí a ṣètò, nítorí náà a kò pèsè ohunkóhun.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Àṣẹ yìí kò ní orúkọ domain nínú, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè pèsè.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Pẹpẹ igbalejo ko da aaye pada.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'Alejo Zinn® ti pese silẹ fun %1$s (iṣẹ %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Pẹpẹ igbalejo ko da akọọlẹ alabara pada.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'A KO pèsè alejo gbigba Zinn®: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Ìlànà ọjà Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Laini ọja Zinn® lati pese nigbati a ba ra ọja yii. Fi silẹ ni ofifo lati lo aiyipada lati awọn eto itanna.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Alejo Zinn®','Service id'=>'ID iṣẹ́','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'A kò pèsè ohunkóhun fún àṣẹ yìí.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'A ti fipamọ́. Tẹ iye titun kan lati rọ́pò rẹ.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣẹ àtòjọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Ṣàlẹ̀kù àkójọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bá àlẹ̀mọ́ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Ṣafikun ọ̀wọ́ kan','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ìlà yìí kúrò','Remove'=>'Yọ kúrò','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Akopọ','Copied'=>'Ti daakọ','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo ohun-itanna Zinn® lori aaye yii, ati boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Kò sí àsopọ̀ tí a nílò fún àfikún yìí.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati yi awọn eto wọnyi pada.','Settings sections'=>'Àwọn abala ètò','Support'=>'Atilẹyin','Save changes'=>'Fi àwọn àyípadà pamọ́','Tools'=>'Àwọn irinṣẹ́','Export settings'=>'Gbe àwọn ètò jáde','Reset to defaults'=>'Tunto si aiyipada','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò mú gbogbo ètò lórí àfikún yìí padà sí ti àkọ́kọ́ rẹ̀. Ṣé kí a tẹ̀síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Awọn iwadii fun atilẹyin','Import a settings file'=>'Kó fáìlì ètò wọlé','Import'=>'Kowọle','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Awọn faili ti a firanṣẹ si okeere ko ni awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle, awọn àmì tabi awọn kọkọrọ API rara — iwọ yoo nilo lati tẹ wọn sii lẹẹkansi lori aaye tuntun naa.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ètò pamọ́.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lórí àtúnṣe-àfikún yìí ti padà sí àbùdá rẹ̀.','Done.'=>'Ti parí.','That action is not available.'=>'Igbese yẹn ko si.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'A kò lè ka fáìlì yẹn. Yan fáìlì ètò tí a gbà jáde láti inú àfikún Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn tóbi jù láti jẹ́ ìmúwọlé ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kìí ṣe ìmúkúrò ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'A ṣe àgbéwọle fáìlì yẹn láti inú àfikún mìíràn (%s), nítorí náà mímú wọlé síhìn-ín yóò fi àwọn ètò tí àfikún yìí kò lóye pamọ́.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'A ti gbe ètò %d wọlé. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé àti àwọn kókó API kì í sí nínú ìgbéjáde rárá, nítorí náà tún wọn tẹ̀ sii.','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Connecting…'=>'Nṣe àsopọ̀…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ti so pọ̀, ṣùgbọ́n ohun kan nílò àfiyèsí','Not connected'=>'A kò so pọ̀','Running on your own account'=>'Nṣiṣẹ lori akọọlẹ ti ara rẹ','We could not check this'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Àfikún yìí kò sọ ìdí rẹ̀. Fi ìròyìn ìwádìí ìṣòro ránṣẹ́ a ó sì wò ó.','Connection status'=>'Ipo isopọ','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Ayẹwo to kẹhin jẹ́ %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ṣi si taabu tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi èyí ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí gan-an ni ohun tí a óò firanṣẹ — kò sí ohun míràn, kò sì sí ohun tí a fi pamọ́. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé, àwọn tókìn, àti àwọn kókó API yín kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ìjábọ̀ àyẹ̀wò tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣe àwòkọ sí pátákó ìpamọ́','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ijabọ yii ranṣẹ si atilẹyin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A ṣí tikẹti atilẹyin fun ọ ati pe a fesi nipasẹ imeeli. Ti o ko ba fẹ fi ranṣẹ, daakọ loke ki o lẹ mọ tikẹti kan funrararẹ.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital® lati olupin yii (%s). Da iroyin ti o wa loke ki o si ṣi tiketi dipo — ko si ohun ti o buru pẹlu awọn eto rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Ẹ̀ka ìrànwọ́ Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn rẹ, wọn yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ imeeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Ẹ̀ka ìrànwọ́ Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn rẹ — ìtọ́kasí %s — wọn yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Ẹ ti fi ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìròyìn ránṣẹ́ láàárín àkókò kúkúrú. Ẹ dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí ẹ sì tún gbìyànjú — àwọn ti tẹ́lẹ̀ ti dé.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò le gba ìròyìn náà wọlé ní báyìí — láti ọ̀dọ̀ wa ni, kì í ṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ yín. Ẹ tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi láìpẹ́, tàbí kí ẹ da ìròyìn tó wà lókè yìí kọ sínú tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'A kọ ijabọ naa (HTTP %d). Daakọ loke ki o si ṣi tikẹti kan, pẹlu sisọ nọmba yẹn.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — awọn itọsọna ati awọn iṣẹ','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà aṣàmúlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi èyí pa mọ́','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Alejo Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣípòpadà ọ̀fẹ́ àti pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tó ju ẹyọ kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ki o si ta awọn aaye ti a ti fi idi rẹ mulẹ, awọn orukọ ìkànnì ati gbigbe ọna asopọ, pẹlu owo ti a tọju lailewu titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba àwọn ènìyàn tí iṣẹ́ yìí jẹ́ ohun ìgbésí ayé wọn','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn oṣiṣẹ́ aládàáni ti gbogbo àgbáyé wa: wò ju 10,000 àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ láti ọwọ́ àwọn olùkọ̀wé, àwọn olùṣe àwòrán, àwọn olùgbédàgbà àti àwọn SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ akanṣe sílẹ̀ kí o jẹ́ kí wọ́n dúnádúurà.','Style preset'=>'Ètò àkànṣe àṣà','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ibi ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kan. Ohun kòun tí ó wà nísàlẹ̀ ń tẹ̀ ẹ́ mọ́lẹ̀.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo àwọn àwọ̀ àti àwọn ìwọ̀n ti tèmi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi eyi silẹ ni pipa ati pe a maa lo eto tẹlẹ gẹgẹ bi o ti ri gangan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ìtúsílẹ̀ Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìṣàfikún Zinn® kò pèsè ọ̀nà ìgbàsílẹ̀ fún ìṣàfikún yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè dé orí pẹpẹ Zinn®, lẹ́yìn náà gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Imudojuiwọn naa ko le ṣe igbasilẹ lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Àfikún tí a gba sílẹ̀ kùnà nínú àyẹ̀wò àìlábùkù rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sí orí ẹ̀rọ.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Kò le parí iṣẹ́ náà. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, bí kò bá sì tíì ṣiṣẹ́, kàn sí alámòójútó ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','Connect an AI app'=>'So ohun elo AI pọ̀','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìsopọ̀ yìí ti parí. Padà sí inú àfilọ́lẹ̀ náà kí o sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní sopọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s ń bèèrè láti lo %2$s lórí sátì yìí gẹ́gẹ́ bí %3$s. Ó le ṣe àwọn ohun tí a gba àkọọ́lẹ̀ WordPress rẹ láyè láti ṣe ǹkan, o sì le yà á kurò nígbàkigbà láti àwọn ètè aṣojú AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ṣe idanimọ ara rẹ lati %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ti forukọsilẹ funrararẹ laifọwọyi. Tẹsiwaju nikan ti o ba bẹrẹ eyi lati %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ kò le lo àwọn irinṣẹ́ wọ̀nyí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ olùṣàkóso kan.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Lẹ́yìn tí ẹ bá dáhùn, ẹ ó padà sí %s.','Allow %s'=>'Gba %s láàyè','Do not allow'=>'Maa ṣe gba laaye','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Iye kan ti a nilo sonu tabi o ni ọna kika ti ko tọ. Ṣayẹwo ilana titẹ sii (input schema) ti agbara naa.','The site refused the request.'=>'Ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà kọ̀ ìbéèrè náà.','Unknown tool.'=>'Irinṣẹ́ aimọ̀.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Gba awọn oluranlọwọ AI bii Claude, Cursor tabi VS Code laaye lati ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii fun ọ nipasẹ MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wọn wọle bi olumulo WordPress kan (Claude ati ChatGPT nipa fọwọsi wọn nibi, awọn miiran pẹlu ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo kan) ati pe wọn le ṣe ohun ti a gba olumulo yẹn laaye lati ṣe nikan.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Àwọn aṣojú AI nílò WordPress 6.9 tàbí tuntun sí i. Ṣe àfikún àmúgbégà sí WordPress láti lò wọ́n.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì ìsopọ̀ (ojú-ìparí MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude ati ChatGPT: wọle dipo','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ṣafikun àdírẹ́sì ìsopọ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí asopọ̀ àṣà ní Claude, tàbí gẹ́gẹ́ bí àpù ní ipò olùgbédide ti ChatGPT. Wọ́n ń ṣí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kí ẹ lè fọwọ́sí wọn; kò sí ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé láti ṣe ẹ̀dà rẹ̀.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Àwọn àmuso AI tí a so pọ̀ mọ́ àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ:','Disconnect'=>'Ge asopọ kuro','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Awọn ohun elo AI miiran: ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ṣẹda ọ̀rọ̀ìpamọ́ ohun-èlò fún olùlò rẹ','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ṣafikun eyi si awọn eto MCP ti app AI rẹ, pẹlu orukọ olumulo rẹ ati ọrọ igbaniwọle yẹn:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: fi àkọsílẹ̀ kan náà sábẹ́ "servers" nínú .vscode/mcp.json, kì í ṣe sábẹ́ "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ ti aṣoju AI le lo nibi (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Itọsọna olumulo: Awọn aṣoju AI ati MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Awọn iwe aṣẹ olùgbéejáde: awọn agbara, REST ati MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn alabara alejo gbigba rẹ, awọn eto wọn ati awọn aaye wọn lori Zinn Digital® lati aaye yii.','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'Àwọn oníbàárà rẹ, àwọn ètò wọn àti àwọn ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù wọn, nípasẹ̀ àkọọ́lẹ̀ àtúntà Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Read your reseller account'=>'Ka àkọọ́lẹ̀ alatunreṣe rẹ','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'O da akọọlẹ atunta rẹ pada ni kika kan: aami, awọn eto, iye awọn alabara ati awọn iṣẹ, ati ohun ti a ṣeto.','List your clients'=>'Ṣe atokọ awọn alabara rẹ','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn àkọọ́lẹ̀ oníbàárà rẹ, ojú-ìwé kan ní àkókò kan (cursor, limit).','Create a client'=>'Ṣẹda alabara kan','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'Ó ń ṣẹ̀dá àkópọ̀ oníbàárà kan lábẹ́ tiyín (name; default_currency, àmì-ọ̀rọ̀ lẹ́tà mẹ́ta). Fi wọ́n sínú ètò kan ṣáájú ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù àkọ́kọ́ wọn.','Read a client\'s plan'=>'Ka ètò oníbàárà kan','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'Ó ń da ètò tí oníbàárà wà àti iye tí ó ń náni padà (client_id).','Put a client on a plan'=>'Fi onibaara sori eto kan','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'Fi onibara kan si ọkan ninu awọn eto rẹ (client_id, plan_code; interval: month tabi year). Ṣe eyi ṣaaju aaye akọkọ wọn.','List the plans you can sell'=>'Ṣe akojọ awọn eto ti o le ta','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'Ṣe atokọ awọn eto gbigbalejo ati awọn idiyele wọn (product_line ati currency dín rẹ kù).','List your clients\' sites'=>'Ṣe akojọ awọn aaye awọn onibara rẹ','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ gbogbo ohun tí ẹ ti pèsè fún àwọn oníbàárà yín (client_id àti status ń dín i kù), ojú-ìwé kan nígbà kan.','Create a site for a client'=>'Ṣẹ́dá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù kan fún oníbàárà kan','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'Ó ń ṣẹ̀dá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tí a gbàlejò fún ọ̀kan nínú àwọn oníbàárà yín (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). A máa gba owó rẹ̀ lórí àkópọ̀-ìwé yín ní ètò oníbàárà náà, gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe wá láti ilé-ìtajà yín.','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'Dá ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù oníbàárà kan dúró','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'Fi ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù oníbàárà sí ipò ìdádúró nítorí àìsanwó (site_id; ìdí: àkọsílẹ̀ tirẹ fúnra rẹ, kò ní hàn sí oníbàárà rárá). Ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà yóò dáwọ́ iṣẹ́ dúró títí tí a ó fi yọ ọ́ kúrò nínú ìdádúró.','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'Mú ìdádúró kúrò lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù oníbàárà kan','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'Ó mú ìdádúró nítorí àìsanwó kúrò, kí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà lè tún bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí i ṣiṣẹ́ (site_id).','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Ka àwọn ètò Reseller Toolkit','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Ń da àwọn ètò àfikún yìí padà (àdírẹ́sì API, ètò tí àwọn àṣẹ tuntun ń lò, àwọn àbùdá wo ló wà ni títàn). Kọ́kọ́rọ́ API kì í padà rárá, kìkì bóyá a ti fi ọ̀kan pamọ́ ni.','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Yi awọn eto Reseller Toolkit pada','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'Ó ń yí àwọn ètò tí ẹ fi ránṣẹ́ padà (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) ó sì ń pa àwọn tókù mọ́. Kóòdù API àti àdírẹ́sì máa yípadà lórí ojú ìbòjú nìkan.','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ fi kọ́kọ́rọ́ API àtúntajà Zinn Digital® rẹ kún un lórí ojú-ìbòjú Reseller Toolkit.']];